// ============================================================================
// v17.56.5 CHANGELOG — Flip Zone Intelligence (Strict Classification)
// ============================================================================
// [2026-06-01] v17.56.5 — LOGIC UPGRADE: Flip Zone Intelligence
//
// IMPLEMENTED: Strict 3-Point Flip Zone Classification
//   1. Opposing Zone Context: Prior zone of opposite type must exist
//   2. Confirmed Reaction: Price reacted to opposing zone in last 20 bars
//   3. Displacement Breakthrough: Breakout displacement > 1.0 ATR
//
// NEW: Per-zone flip classification arrays (dFlip[], sFlip[]) track each zone
//      as flip (true) or standard (false), kept in sync with dTop/dBot/sTop/sBot.
//
// NEW: Flip Zone state tracking via persistent var variables:
//      hadSupplyZone, hadDemandZone — track opposing zone existence
//      lastSupplyReactionBar, lastDemandReactionBar — track reaction timing
//
// NEW: Zone box labels dynamically show "⬤ FLIP DEMAND" or "⬤ FLIP SUPPLY"
//      when all 3 criteria are met (high-probability flip zones)
//
// NEW: HUD h4ZoneStr appends "(FLIP)" when price is in a zone that is a flip zone
//      Example: "PZ (red) (FLIP)" — visible in LTF Bias row
//
// NEW: Flip Zone persistence — flip zones get 2× maxZoneAge (1000 vs 500 bars)
//      preventing premature pruning of high-quality flip zones
//
// Colors, OB boxes, alerts, and HUD layout unchanged from v17.56.4.
// ============================================================================

